; DATA-side variables: the stored atoms contain $. Exercises the `vs!` macro (the
; child-mask VARS loop) in the Symbol, Arity and VarRef branches — a data var byte
; ABSORBS the whole remaining pattern sub-term. Dropping vs! from any branch loses
; these matches silently.
(f $)
(g 7)
(h (k $))
(j (k 9))
(exec 0 (, (f $x) (g $x)) (, (o1 $x)))
(exec 1 (, (h $y) (j $y)) (, (o2 $y)))
